<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Generar Imagenes</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/styles.css" />
  </head>
  <body class="dashboard-body" data-page="generate-images">
    <div class="dashboard-layout">
      <%- include("partials/dashboard-sidebar", {
        activeMenu,
        isSidebarCollapsed: false,
        product: null,
        allProducts: [],
        basename,
        fileUrl,
        explicitSelections: 0
      }) %>

      <main class="dashboard-content">
        <section class="topbar app-topbar">
          <div class="topbar-title">
            <p class="eyebrow">Wizard</p>
            <h2>Generar Imagenes</h2>
            <p class="muted">Carga productos, elige un modelo del catalogo y selecciona las fotos del modelo que quieras usar. Las primeras 4 se tomaran como poses base del lote y las demas ayudaran como referencia adicional.</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="summary-card wizard-shell">
          <div class="wizard-progress">
            <button class="wizard-step active" type="button" data-step="1">1. Productos</button>
            <button class="wizard-step" type="button" data-step="2">2. Modelo</button>
            <button class="wizard-step" type="button" data-step="3">3. Prompt</button>
            <button class="wizard-step" type="button" data-step="4">4. Fondo</button>
            <button class="wizard-step" type="button" data-step="5">5. API fal.ai</button>
          </div>

          <form id="generation-wizard" class="wizard-form">
            <section class="wizard-panel active" data-step-panel="1">
              <div class="wizard-copy">
                <p class="summary-kicker">Paso 1</p>
                <h3>Productos / vestimenta</h3>
                <p class="muted">Puedes soltar imagenes sueltas, una carpeta con imagenes o una carpeta contenedora con varias carpetas de producto. Si subes imagenes sueltas, cada imagen se toma como un producto independiente.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="prompt-shell wizard-client-shell">
                <label for="wizard-client-id">Cliente</label>
                <select id="wizard-client-id" class="wizard-select">
                  <option value="">Sin cliente</option>
                  <% for (const client of clients) { %>
                    <option value="<%= client.clientId %>" <%= selectedClientId === client.clientId ? "selected" : "" %>><%= client.name %></option>
                  <% } %>
                </select>
                <p class="muted">Al elegir un cliente, en el paso de modelo solo se mostraran modelos vinculados a ese cliente o libres.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="dropzone" data-dropzone="garments">
                <input id="garments-file-input" type="file" class="wizard-file-input" accept="image/*" multiple hidden />
                <input id="garments-folder-input" type="file" class="wizard-file-input" accept="image/*" webkitdirectory directory multiple hidden />
                <p class="dropzone-title">Arrastra prendas o carpetas aqui</p>
                <p class="muted">Tambien puedes explorar tu equipo y seleccionar una carpeta o varias imagenes.</p>
                <div class="dropzone-actions">
                  <button type="button" class="secondary wizard-pick-button" data-target-input="garments-file-input">Agregar imagenes</button>
                  <button type="button" class="secondary wizard-pick-button" data-target-input="garments-folder-input">Agregar carpeta</button>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="wizard-list" id="garments-summary"></div>
            </section>

            <section class="wizard-panel" data-step-panel="2">
              <div class="wizard-copy">
                <p class="summary-kicker">Paso 2</p>
                <h3>Modelo</h3>
                <p class="muted">Selecciona un modelo del catalogo y marca al menos 1 foto del modelo. Cada foto seleccionada podra tener su propio prompt extra en el paso 3.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="wizard-model-grid">
                <div class="summary-card dashboard-card">
                  <div class="panel-head">
                    <div>
                      <p class="summary-kicker">Catalogo</p>
                      <h3>Modelos disponibles</h3>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div id="wizard-model-catalog" class="wizard-model-catalog"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="summary-card dashboard-card">
                  <div class="panel-head">
                    <div>
                      <p class="summary-kicker">Seleccion</p>
                      <h3>Fotos del modelo</h3>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div id="wizard-selected-model-empty" class="empty-state wizard-empty">Selecciona un modelo para ver sus fotos y elegir cuales enviar a la API.</div>
                  <div id="wizard-selected-model-shell" class="wizard-selected-model-shell" hidden>
                    <div class="wizard-selected-model-head">
                      <div>
                        <h4 id="wizard-selected-model-name">-</h4>
                        <p id="wizard-selected-model-meta" class="muted">-</p>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div id="wizard-model-photo-picker" class="wizard-model-photo-picker"></div>
                    <p class="muted">Selecciona al menos 1 foto del modelo. Si eliges menos de 4, la app reutilizara la ultima para completar internamente las 4 poses del lote.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section class="wizard-panel" data-step-panel="3">
              <div class="wizard-copy">
                <p class="summary-kicker">Paso 3</p>
                <h3>Prompt</h3>
                <p class="muted">Define un prompt general para todo el lote y agrega instrucciones extra por cada foto seleccionada del modelo cuando haga falta.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="wizard-prompt-grid">
                <details class="system-prompt-toggle">
                  <summary>Prompt del sistema</summary>
                  <div class="prompt-shell system-prompt-shell">
                    <p class="muted">Este bloque define los lineamientos generales que el sistema enviara junto con tu prompt.</p>
                    <textarea id="wizard-system-prompt" rows="10" placeholder="Escribe aqui el prompt del sistema..."><%= defaultSystemPrompt %></textarea>
                  </div>
                </details>
                <div class="prompt-shell">
                  <label for="wizard-general-prompt">Prompt general</label>
                  <textarea id="wizard-general-prompt" rows="8" placeholder="Escribe aqui el prompt general del lote..."></textarea>
                </div>
                <div id="wizard-photo-prompts" class="wizard-pose-prompts">
                  <div class="empty-state wizard-empty">Selecciona una o mas fotos del modelo en el paso 2 para agregarles un prompt extra individual.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section class="wizard-panel" data-step-panel="4">
              <div class="wizard-copy">
                <p class="summary-kicker">Paso 4</p>
                <h3>Fondo</h3>
                <p class="muted">Configura el estilo del fondo para construir instrucciones consistentes en el prompt sin mezclar opciones incompatibles.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="wizard-provider-grid">
                <div class="prompt-shell">
                  <label for="wizard-background-mode">Modo de fondo</label>
                  <select id="wizard-background-mode" class="wizard-select">
                    <option value="white">Blanco solido</option>
                    <option value="bokeh">Bokeh</option>
                    <option value="studio">Estudio</option>
                    <option value="exterior_natural">Exterior natural</option>
                    <option value="exterior_urbano">Exterior urbano</option>
                    <option value="interior_lifestyle">Interior lifestyle</option>
                    <option value="custom">Personalizado</option>
                  </select>
                </div>

                <div class="prompt-shell wizard-background-advanced" data-background-hide-for="white">
                  <label for="wizard-background-scene">Escenario</label>
                  <select id="wizard-background-scene" class="wizard-select">
                    <option value="none">Sin escenario</option>
                    <option value="arquitectura_moderna">Arquitectura moderna</option>
                    <option value="calle_limpia">Calle limpia</option>
                    <option value="terraza">Terraza</option>
                    <option value="fachada_neutra">Fachada neutra</option>
                    <option value="bosque">Bosque</option>
                    <option value="mar">Mar</option>
                    <option value="sendero">Sendero</option>
                    <option value="jardin">Jardin</option>
                    <option value="campo">Campo</option>
                    <option value="living_minimalista">Living minimalista</option>
                    <option value="estudio_creativo">Estudio creativo</option>
                    <option value="cafe_elegante">Cafe elegante</option>
                    <option value="vestidor">Vestidor</option>
                    <option value="gimnasio_premium">Gimnasio premium</option>
                    <option value="papel_seamless">Papel seamless</option>
                    <option value="cemento_suave">Cemento suave</option>
                  </select>
                </div>

                <div class="prompt-shell">
                  <label for="wizard-background-lighting">Luz</label>
                  <select id="wizard-background-lighting" class="wizard-select">
                    <option value="clear_soft_daylight">Luz clara suave</option>
                    <option value="warm_soft_daylight">Luz calida suave</option>
                    <option value="cool_soft_daylight">Luz fria suave</option>
                    <option value="studio_diffused">Estudio difuso</option>
                    <option value="high_key">High key</option>
                    <option value="editorial">Editorial</option>
                    <option value="dramatic">Dramatica</option>
                    <option value="overcast_soft">Nublado suave</option>
                    <option value="golden_hour">Golden hour</option>
                  </select>
                </div>

                <div class="prompt-shell wizard-background-advanced" data-background-hide-for="white">
                  <label for="wizard-background-bokeh">Fuerza del bokeh</label>
                  <input id="wizard-background-bokeh" class="wizard-input" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="45" />
                  <p class="muted"><span id="wizard-background-bokeh-value">45</span>% desenfoque de fondo</p>
                </div>

                <div class="prompt-shell wizard-background-advanced" data-background-hide-for="white">
                  <label for="wizard-background-color">Color dominante</label>
                  <select id="wizard-background-color" class="wizard-select">
                    <option value="white">Blanco</option>
                    <option value="neutral gray">Gris neutro</option>
                    <option value="warm beige">Beige calido</option>
                    <option value="soft blue">Azul suave</option>
                    <option value="forest green">Verde bosque</option>
                    <option value="ocean blue">Azul mar</option>
                    <option value="sand">Arena</option>
                    <option value="black">Negro</option>
                  </select>
                </div>

                <div class="prompt-shell wizard-background-advanced" data-background-hide-for="white">
                  <label for="wizard-background-prominence">Protagonismo del fondo</label>
                  <select id="wizard-background-prominence" class="wizard-select">
                    <option value="minimal">Minimo</option>
                    <option value="medium">Medio</option>
                    <option value="editorial">Editorial</option>
                  </select>
                </div>

                <div class="prompt-shell wizard-background-advanced" data-background-hide-for="white">
                  <label for="wizard-background-contrast">Contraste</label>
                  <select id="wizard-background-contrast" class="wizard-select">
                    <option value="soft">Suave</option>
                    <option value="medium">Medio</option>
                    <option value="high">Alto</option>
                  </select>
                </div>

                <div class="prompt-shell wizard-background-advanced" data-background-hide-for="white">
                  <label for="wizard-background-realism">Realismo</label>
                  <select id="wizard-background-realism" class="wizard-select">
                    <option value="catalogo_realista">Catalogo realista</option>
                    <option value="campana_lifestyle">Campana lifestyle</option>
                  </select>
                </div>

                <div class="prompt-shell">
                  <label for="wizard-background-separation">Separacion sujeto/fondo</label>
                  <select id="wizard-background-separation" class="wizard-select">
                    <option value="standard">Estandar</option>
                    <option value="strong" selected>Fuerte</option>
                    <option value="maximum">Maxima</option>
                  </select>
                </div>

                <label class="wizard-checkbox wizard-background-advanced" data-background-hide-for="white">
                  <input id="wizard-background-no-people" type="checkbox" checked />
                  <span>Sin gente extra</span>
                </label>

                <label class="wizard-checkbox wizard-background-advanced" data-background-hide-for="white">
                  <input id="wizard-background-no-props" type="checkbox" checked />
                  <span>Sin props distractores</span>
                </label>

                <label class="wizard-checkbox">
                  <input id="wizard-background-no-text" type="checkbox" checked />
                  <span>Sin texto o senaletica</span>
                </label>
              </div>

              <div class="prompt-shell wizard-background-custom-shell">
                <label for="wizard-background-custom">Detalle extra de fondo</label>
                <textarea id="wizard-background-custom" rows="4" placeholder="Ej. bosque suave con bokeh medio y luz calida, sin elementos que compitan con la prenda"></textarea>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section class="wizard-panel" data-step-panel="5">
              <div class="wizard-copy">
                <p class="summary-kicker">Paso 5</p>
                <h3>Configuracion de fal.ai</h3>
                <p class="muted">Aqui eliges el modelo de imagen y los parametros principales soportados por el proveedor oficial correspondiente para esta corrida.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="wizard-provider-grid">
                <div class="prompt-shell">
                  <label for="wizard-fal-model">Modelo de imagen</label>
                  <select id="wizard-fal-model" class="wizard-select">
                    <% for (const modelId of falModelOptions) { %>
                      <option value="<%= modelId %>" <%= modelId === defaultProviderSettings.modelId ? "selected" : "" %>><%= modelId %></option>
                    <% } %>
                  </select>
                </div>

                <div class="prompt-shell">
                  <label for="wizard-image-size">Image size</label>
                  <select id="wizard-image-size" class="wizard-select">
                    <option value="square_hd" <%= defaultProviderSettings.imageSize === "square_hd" ? "selected" : "" %>>square_hd</option>
                    <option value="square" <%= defaultProviderSettings.imageSize === "square" ? "selected" : "" %>>square</option>
                    <option value="portrait_4_3" <%= defaultProviderSettings.imageSize === "portrait_4_3" ? "selected" : "" %>>portrait_4_3</option>
                    <option value="portrait_16_9" <%= defaultProviderSettings.imageSize === "portrait_16_9" ? "selected" : "" %>>portrait_16_9</option>
                    <option value="landscape_4_3" <%= defaultProviderSettings.imageSize === "landscape_4_3" ? "selected" : "" %>>landscape_4_3</option>
                    <option value="landscape_16_9" <%= defaultProviderSettings.imageSize === "landscape_16_9" ? "selected" : "" %>>landscape_16_9</option>
                    <option value="auto_2K" <%= defaultProviderSettings.imageSize === "auto_2K" ? "selected" : "" %>>auto_2K</option>
                    <option value="auto_4K" <%= defaultProviderSettings.imageSize === "auto_4K" ? "selected" : "" %>>auto_4K</option>
                    <option value="custom">custom</option>
                  </select>
                </div>

                <div class="wizard-custom-size-grid" id="wizard-custom-size-grid" hidden>
                  <div class="prompt-shell">
                    <label for="wizard-custom-width">Ancho</label>
                    <input id="wizard-custom-width" class="wizard-input" type="number" min="64" step="1" placeholder="1024" />
                  </div>
                  <div class="prompt-shell">
                    <label for="wizard-custom-height">Alto</label>
                    <input id="wizard-custom-height" class="wizard-input" type="number" min="64" step="1" placeholder="1024" />
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="prompt-shell">
                  <label for="wizard-seed">Seed opcional</label>
                  <input id="wizard-seed" class="wizard-input" type="number" min="0" step="1" placeholder="Dejalo vacio para aleatorio" />
                </div>

                <label class="wizard-checkbox">
                  <input id="wizard-enable-safety" type="checkbox" <%= defaultProviderSettings.enableSafetyChecker ? "checked" : "" %> />
                  <span>Activar safety checker</span>
                </label>

                <label class="wizard-checkbox">
                  <input id="wizard-sync-mode" type="checkbox" <%= defaultProviderSettings.syncMode ? "checked" : "" %> />
                  <span>Usar sync_mode</span>
                </label>
              </div>
            </section>

            <div class="wizard-footer">
              <div id="wizard-feedback" class="flash" aria-live="polite"></div>
              <div class="wizard-footer-actions">
                <button type="button" class="secondary" id="wizard-prev-button">Anterior</button>
                <button type="button" class="secondary" id="wizard-next-button">Siguiente</button>
                <button type="submit" id="wizard-submit-button">Preparar y generar</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </form>
        </section>
      </main>
    </div>

    <script>
      window.__PAGE_MODEL__ = {
        page: "generate-images",
        availableModels: <%- JSON.stringify(availableModels) %>
      };
    </script>
    <script src="/assets/app.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
